Laahu Me Dooba Hai Sehra Ajeeb Manzar Hai<br>
Tadaph Ke Kehti Hai Kubra Ajeeb Manzar Hai<br>
<br>
1.Yeh Khe Ke Shab Ki bheyi Ne Chuduiyan Toodhi<br>
Chadha Hai Rang Hina Ka Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
2.Abhi Toh Haatoun Ki Laali Na Chooth Ne Paayi<br>
Ujadh Gayi Meri Duniya Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
3.Aaba Me Laash Ke Tukhde Utha Rahe Hai Hussain<br>
Na Poch Bare illaha Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
4.Aaba Me Tukhdhou Ku Rakh Kar Hussain Laate Hain<br>
Nirali Shaan Ka Nousha Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
5.Yeh Ek Shab Ki Bheyi Ke Run Me Naale Hain<br>
Luthaa Suhaag Khudara Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
6.Yakheen Aata Nahin Mujh ku Kuch Batou Toh<br>
Main Kaise Hogayi Bewa Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
7.Utha Rahe Hai Shaheedou Ke Laashe Maqtal Se<br>
Aur Is Pe Shukr Ka Sajda Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
8.Sukoon Aata Tha JIsku Pidar Ke Seene Par<br>
Wo Kharahi Hai Tamacha Ajeeb Manzar Hain<br>
<br>
9.Na Likh Sakeyenga Naqi Rokhle Qalam Apna<br>
Hai Dil Kharaj Yeh Lamha Ajeeb Manzar Hain
